DETAIL:  cannot grant privilege of syssso_role/syssao_role member to anyone
grant all on schema sch_syssao_u1 to u1;
ERROR:  permission denied
DETAIL:  cannot grant privilege of syssso_role/syssao_role member to anyone
grant all on schema sch_u1 to syssao_u1;
ERROR:  permission denied
